          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "1a.1",
              "text": "Halvern Dam and its right abutment were damaged, prompting emergency response in the Assek Valley. A mandatory evacuation was ordered for Brindlemark and Ferris Hollow, moving approximately 11,800 residents and raising the alert level from Yellow to Orange. Displacement extended to Quennard, with police deployed and assistance provided in affected areas.",
